/TU (Page 6\056 Section 5\072 Monthly Income and Expenses \050Foreign and Domestic\051\056 Monthly Income\057Expenses Statement \050For additional inforamtion\054 refer to Publication 1854\056\051 Total Income \050Amounts reported in U\056S\056 dollars\051\056 21\056 Source\056 Wages \050Taxpayer\051\056 Wages\054 salaries\054 pensions\054 and social security\072 Enter gross monthly wages and\057or salaries\056 Do not deduct tax withholding or allotments taken out of pay\054 such as insurance payments\054 credit union deductions\054 car payments\054 etc\056 To calculate the gross monthly wages and\057or salaries\072 If paid weekly \055 multiply weekly gross wages by 4\0563\056 Example\072 \044425\05689 multiplied by 4\0563 equals \0441\054831\05633\056 If paid biweekly \050every 2 weeks\051 \055 multiply biweekly gross wages by 2\05617\056 Example\072 \044972\05645 multiplied by 2\05617 equals \0442\054110\05622\056 If paid semimonthly \050twice each month\051 \055 multiply semimonthly gross wages by 2\056 Example\072 \044856\05623 multiplied by 2 equals \0441\054712\05646\056 Gross Monthly\056 \044\056)
/Type /Annot
/V (XXX\055XX\0551234)
